WEBVTT

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:31.412
in a huge variety of environments,

00:13:31.412 --> 00:13:33.233
and we could learn from this

00:13:33.233 --> 00:13:35.010
about other systems that operate

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.347
without central control.

00:13:37.347 --> 00:13:39.326
Using only simple interactions,

00:13:39.326 --> 00:13:41.121
ant colonies have been performing

00:13:41.121 --> 00:13:44.754
amazing feats for more than 130 million years.

00:13:44.754 --> 00:13:46.894
We have a lot to learn from them.

00:13:46.894 --> 00:13:49.632
Thank you.

00:13:49.632 --> 00:13:52.365
(Applause)